---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout>
  <main class="min-h-screen bg-zinc-100 px-6 py-16 text-zinc-900">
    <article class="mx-auto max-w-3xl bg-white px-6 py-10 shadow-sm sm:px-10">
      <a href="/" class="text-sm font-semibold text-red-700 hover:text-red-800">&larr; Back to home</a>
      <h1 class="mt-8 text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-zinc-500">Last updated: August 26, 2026</p>

      <div class="mt-10 space-y-8 leading-7 text-zinc-700">
        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-zinc-950">1. Who we are</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">R&amp;J Manufacturing de Mexico operates this website. For privacy questions, contact us at <a class="text-red-700 underline" href="mailto:REPLACE_WITH_PRIVACY_EMAIL">REPLACE_WITH_PRIVACY_EMAIL</a>.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-zinc-950">2. Information we collect</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">We may collect the information you provide when you contact us, such as your name, email address, company, phone number, and message. We may also receive basic technical information needed to keep the website secure and operating correctly.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-zinc-950">3. How we use your information</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">We use this information to respond to inquiries, provide requested services, communicate with you about your request, and maintain and improve our website. We do not sell your personal information.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-zinc-950">4. Sharing and retention</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">We may share information with service providers that help us operate the website or respond to inquiries. We retain information only for as long as reasonably necessary for these purposes, legal obligations, or the establishment and defense of legal claims.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-zinc-950">5. Your rights</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">Depending on where you live, you may have rights to access, correct, delete, or restrict the use of your personal information. To submit a request, contact us using the email above. You may also have the right to lodge a complaint with your local data protection authority.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-zinc-950">6. Changes to this policy</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Any changes will be posted on this page with an updated revision date.</p>
        </section>
      </div>
    </article>
  </main>
</Layout>
